            "notes": "## Items\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is insane for Tracer, providing roughly 20% more damage at the cost of burning more ammo.\n\nThe alternative is [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb), which offers more sustain and overhealth. Pick this if your supports can\u2019t heal you reliably, with heroes such as [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000), [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da), [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed), or [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18).\n\nWhenever you have money, prioritize buying [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) as your main damage item.\n\nThe other new item is [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016). Pick this against heroes that shoot lots of small bullets. It's 30% flat damage reduction versus Moira rightclick, around 25% versus [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46), and 50% versus [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a), [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) and [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457).\n\nIf you are ahead or don\u2019t feel you need [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016), replace it with another rare damage item. On poorer rounds, this item is the least important.",
